tell me what I want to know.

565
00:55:42.152 --> 00:55:45.254
It is inevitable.
Like dying.

566
00:55:45.255 --> 00:55:49.358
But know this, there will come a
point where I don't give a shit

567
00:55:49.359 --> 00:55:54.463
